    "body": "Upstream-backed repair for the current R03 live blocker.\n\nEvidence:\n- live run 33243157332 fails in `lester / agent` while the generated v0.86.2 contract contains a system `Install ripgrep` bootstrap step;\n- upstream github/gh-aw PR #54305 removed that dependency and shipped in v0.87.2;\n- compiler asset is pinned to the official v0.87.2 linux-amd64 SHA-256.\n\nThis first PR iteration intentionally leaves the old generated lock committed so the read-only compile gate can produce the exact v0.87.2 lock artifact. The generated artifact will then be committed without hand-editing, and CI rerun fresh.\n\nNo main write, no production event mutation, no PR #111/#103 or issue #102 mutation.",
